  "gathering_position": 16,
  "lines": [
    {
      "number": 1,
      "text": "Ich hab dieses für Dich gemacht, Domine. Und da ich",
      "register": "mixed",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "I made this for You, O Lord. And reading"
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "text": "es wider lese, finde ich, daß ich es auch für den",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "it back, I find that I also made it for"
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "text": "gemacht hab, der es einst findet — welches bedeutet,",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "whoever finds it — which means"
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "text": "daß der Stoltz, den ich fürchtete, von Anfang an da",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "that the pride I feared was there from the beginning,"
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "text": "war, und ich gläube nun, das ist nicht die Sünde,",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "and I think now that is not the sin"
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "text": "für die ich es hielt. Augustinus schrieb für Gott",
      "register": "mixed",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "I believed it was. Augustine wrote for God"
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "text": "und schrieb für jedermann und empfand beides nicht",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "and wrote for everyone and did not experience these"
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "text": "als verschieden. Das ist jedem möglich, der ehrlich",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "as different. That is possible for anyone who is honest"
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "text": "genug ist — weßhalb dieses zweyundzwantzig Jar",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "enough — which is why this took twenty-two years"
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "text": "brauchte, umb anzufangen, und vier Monde, umb fast",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "to begin and four months to almost"
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "text": "verbrannt zu werden.",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "be burned."
    },
    {
      "number": 12,
      "text": "Ich werde es nicht verbrennen.",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "I am not going to burn it."
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "text": "Ich werde es hieher legen, zwischen das Breviarium",
      "register": "mixed",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "I am going to put it here, between the Breviarium"
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "text": "zu meiner Lincken und das alte Lectionarium zu",
      "register": "mixed",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "on my left and the old Lectionary on"
    },
    {
      "number": 15,
      "text": "meiner Rechten, und wer nach mir kommet, wird es",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "my right, and whoever comes after me will"
    },
    {
      "number": 16,
      "text": "finden oder nicht finden, und das ist das gantze",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "find it or not find it, and that is the full"
    },
    {
      "number": 17,
      "text": "Maß meiner Überlieferung.",
      "register": "de",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "type": "confidence",
          "detail": {
            "score": 0.96
          }
        }
      ],
      "english": "extent of my transmission."
    }
